# assets (the assetpack pipeline's output). All generated by vite.assetpack.ts
# from ../assets, and none of it is checked in: the built sprites are a
# derivative of the authored art, and the manifest is written even when there
# is no art at all so that the `$lib/manifest.json` import still resolves.
